# P5R Countdown Widget Changelog

A countdown widget in the style of Persona 5 Royal.

## [Unreleased]

## [1.0.0] - 2026-10-15

### Added

- Brush-stroke style black background behind the bottom bar, with a fixed shape that only stretches with the text length
- Hollow parts of glyphs (e.g. "P", "G", "日") are now filled with black inside the outline

### Changed

- The widget size now fits its content instead of using large fixed margins
- The bottom bar has a minimum width; longer text first grows leftward within it, and the bar only extends once the text is longer
- All text is horizontally condensed and bolder; the event title is tilted at -19°
- "距离", "还剩" and the day digits are smaller; "日" is resized to match
- The bottom bar is taller and slightly raised relative to the text
- Renamed the "Todo Message" setting to "Target" (existing values are kept)

### Fixed

- Black outline of rotated text being cut off by a square boundary
- Outline radius setting being capped by the shader loop limit
- Jagged edges on the outline and on rotated rectangles
- Rotated labels looking italic after being condensed
- Widget content being shifted and clipped by leftover layout offsets

## [0.0.1] - 2026-01-15

### Added

- Initial release of P5R Countdown Widget
